# TinyAssets daemon-only request-admission secret.
#
# Install as /etc/tinyassets/request-idempotency.env with owner
# root:tinyassets and mode 640. Do not inject it into workers, tunnel, or logs.
# Generate canonical base64 for 48 random bytes and never reuse the
# daemon-only agent-interchange key. Once admitted records exist, this key is
# immutable during ordinary deploys. A reviewed incident response can rotate it
# explicitly after the daemon-only boundary is live, invalidating old witnesses.
TINYASSETS_REQUEST_IDEMPOTENCY_HMAC_KEY=
